.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/dsa-quest/progress.db
Progress database (SQLite). Holds user state only: XP, cards, review log,
attempts, submissions, mistakes, streaks, unlocks, achievements.
Content is not stored here.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/dsa-quest/workspace/attempt-N/
Per\-attempt C++ project for editing in your own editor. Contains
.IR solution.cpp ,
.IR statement.md ,
.I compile_commands.json
and a
.I tests/
directory. Kept after the attempt so you can review what you wrote.
.TP
.I <install>/content/patterns/*.yaml
Pattern definitions: signals, anti\-signals, confusions, invariant, traps,
recall rubric.
.TP
.I <install>/content/problems/*.yaml
Problem statements, one file per pattern.
.TP
.I <install>/content/templates/*.cpp
Canonical C++ templates, with Code Completion holes marked inline as comments.
.TP
.I <install>/content/exercises.yaml
Sample inputs for differential judging. Deliberately contains no expected
outputs.
.
